summary: CheetahTopo - hiking/topo style for Amazfit Cheetah Pro

# Version of the style itself
#
version=1.0

# A longer description of the style.
description {
CheetahTopo is a hiking/topographic style for the Amazfit Cheetah Pro
(Zepp OS tiled Garmin IMG maps). Based on the mkgmap default style,
but promotes hiking-relevant features to earlier zoom levels:
paths, footways, tracks, steps and bridleways become visible from
resolution 20 instead of 22/23, buildings from 22, hiking POIs
(peaks, viewpoints, shelters, huts, springs, drinking water) from
18-22. Designed to be readable rather than exhaustive.
}
